  // be painted (harvester hands the bucket to the transcript in one
  // transition). A row that vanished without the card is a wedge.
  expect(
    mid.join('\n'),
    contains(_settledCardBody),
    reason: 'row gone at MID is only legal as a fully-drained frame:\n'
        '${mid.join('\n')}',
  );
}
```

This keeps the invariant-based approach while closing the "vanished silently" gap at the exact capture where it would manifest. Non-blocking — the existing AFTER asserts do eventually police the transition.
